    <h1>When eating and substances tangle</h1>
    <p class="lede">We treat adults whose disordered eating co-occurs with alcohol or drug use. This is not a standalone eating-disorder hospital. If someone needs a dedicated ED residential bed, we will say so and help find it.</p>
