  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>Restriction, binge-purge cycles, and stimulant or alcohol use often share a calendar. Medical detox still comes first when withdrawal is unsafe. Nutrition and medical monitoring sit alongside SUD therapy. Our chef and medical team coordinate meals as part of stabilization, not as a spa amenity.</p>
    <p>Insurance: we are in-network with major PPO plans for our licensed SUD services. Eating-disorder benefits sometimes live on a different line of the policy. We verify both when the clinical picture includes both.</p>
